Z||000002||Haze_Performance||07-10-2001||05:29 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tobin01:<BR><B>i just got on this cuz i want a fiero<BR>im 15 and i have many engines which i can drop into a fiero including a 350, t166, and my favorite a 454<BR>can anyone help me out?  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>454 is just a overkill project. Unless its a 100% showcar, I don't see the reason to stuff a BB in a Fiero. I would stick with a 350. You can get all the horsepower you can possible use out of the SB. What type of Fiero do you like, Notchbacks, Fastbacks, Coupes or SE's? <P>P.S. Welcome to the Forum..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/classicfieroowners3.gif">    </A><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>Click above to visit my website.</B></FONT></FONT>||||reg||14
